[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17221.35, "timestamp": "04:47:01", "text": "他们是我可以随时轻松合作的人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17223.91, "timestamp": "04:47:03", "text": "随便哪天一起出去玩玩之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17227.75, "timestamp": "04:47:07", "text": "我想，还是把它们都留到最后吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17230.35, "timestamp": "04:47:10", "text": "呃，第一次合作就全部搞定了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17232.51, "timestamp": "04:47:12", "text": "合作权"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17235.27, "timestamp": "04:47:15", "text": "所以你只是想得到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17238.07, "timestamp": "04:47:18", "text": "最后一天，伙计们，所以你们这些人"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17239.369, "timestamp": "04:47:19", "author": "@Roku-rin", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8LlS_C2IirDMfA5r2V0q5G1kudp8dmG6RQvz_jCAUT3H-esyEgTNPDwrfCXiyX7Undc9UmHNgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I mean you dont even have to squeeze us in too "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17240.39, "timestamp": "04:47:20", "text": "可以拥有最精彩的时光"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17243.43, "timestamp": "04:47:23", "text": "没有我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17245.03, "timestamp": "04:47:25", "text": "乔，你是想表达这个意思吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17248.628, "timestamp": "04:47:28", "text": "好的。我的天啊。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17251.51, "timestamp": "04:47:31", "text": "不。如果我再说一遍，我想只有 Roku。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17254.23, "timestamp": "04:47:34", "text": "左边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17257.11, "timestamp": "04:47:37", "text": "是的。 Roku。 Roku 和各州。我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17258.83, "timestamp": "04:47:38", "text": "联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17263.35, "timestamp": "04:47:43", "text": "留了下来。不过，就待在这里吧。我会的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17265.03, "timestamp": "04:47:45", "text": "我会帮你联系州政府。不用担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17268.628, "timestamp": "04:47:48", "text": "关于它。我几乎没主动联系过任何人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17271.11, "timestamp": "04:47:51", "text": "此时此刻，每个人都像Stade一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17273.27, "timestamp": "04:47:53", "text": "云端，就是我以前玩《命运》时用的那些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17275.03, "timestamp": "04:47:55", "text": "和。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17276.59, "timestamp": "04:47:56", "text": "耶稣。"}]